# Update your repository README file
Start: Sign into GitHub via desktop browser and open your repository’s README.md file. You need edit permission for this repository.

1. Select the pencil edit icon to enter edit mode. Revise your project introduction content.
2. Click Preview tab and inspect Markdown rendering effect.
3. Write a short commit message describing your edits. Select Commit changes to save your modifications.

